<title>USA: Grey Advertising Inc sets qtly dividends.</title>
<headline>Grey Advertising Inc sets qtly dividends.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grey Advertising said it declared a quarterly dividend on its common stock.</p>
<p>				     Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		     Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $1.00		     $1.00</p>
<p> Pay		  March 18</p>
<p> Record		March 3</p>
<p>----</p>
<p>The company also said it declared a quarterly dividend on its class B common stock.</p>
<p>					Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		     Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $1.00		     $1.00</p>
<p> Pay		  March 18</p>
<p> Record		March 3</p>
</text>
